          "method": "Gateway explicit-invocation verification on macOS arm64: a fresh Claude Code 2.1.309 session (Skill tool, from .claude/skills) and a fresh Codex CLI 0.164.0 read-only session (from .agents/skills) both loaded the project-local copy and followed the ten checks, labelling defects, preferences and unverified items. See gui2-gateway-mobile-checklist-claude-code-gateway and gui2-gateway-mobile-checklist-codex-gateway. This covers skill discovery/loading and instruction-following under explicit invocation only; it does not establish natural triggering, behavioral improvement, the accuracy of individual findings or application behavior. Caveat: Codex's skill list is not printed in its JSON trace, so its discovery is inferred from it opening the exact project-local SKILL.md path unprompted."
